<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-Queensland win Sheffield Shield title.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-Queensland win Sheffield Shield title.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland beat Western Australia by 160 runs on the fifth and final day of the Sheffield Shield final at the WACA Ground on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scores - Queensland 320 (Matthew Mott 86) and 309 (Trevor Barsby 111); Western Australia 165 (Adam Dale 6-38) and 304.</p>
<p>--Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
